00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.900
Many have undertaken to draw up an account

2
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.400
of the things that have been fulfilled among us,

3
00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.140
just as they were handed down to us

4
00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.850
by those who from the first were eyewitnesses

5
00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:52.600
and servants of the word.

6
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.100
With this in mind,

7
00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:01.350
since I myself have carefully investigated everything from the beginning,

8
00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:08.360
